// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'id'. Valid alternatives: ['schemaSet', 'schemaId', 'contentType', 'modelIncludes', 'modelExcludes']
//
// The mirror of neg-extformat-schemaid-on-schemaset.pure: `id` is schemas-only, and a
// Binding names the schema it points at with `schemaId`. The message enumerates the entire
// Binding surface, which is the useful part -- `id` is not among it at any position.
###ExternalFormat
Binding fixture::neg::IdOnBinding
{
   id: primary;
   schemaSet: fixture::neg::Set;
   contentType: 'application/x.flatdata';
   modelIncludes: [ fixture::neg::Person ];
}
